From: MakOS Project <makos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] widget: add MakOS app shell and native mouse events

Provide XPCOM app-shell/widget services, scheduler-backed idle waiting, and
dispatch retained-surface mouse, resize, and close events into Gecko.

